   "body": "A test-only fix is on [the fork branch](https://github.com/skygunner/magpie/tree/fix/5681-session-tests-timezones), commit [a61e22143](https://github.com/skygunner/magpie/commit/a61e2214355a882cf514071facaeba398c6609b2), based on `ed0ab567`.\n\n`TestAgyGrows` uses the same fixed UTC zone fixture as its neighbor. `TestCursor` checks the main session and its subagent against their respective last timestamps: the subagent has no update timestamp and uses its older file time, which can land on a different local day. Production grouping is unchanged.\n\nOn the base, both named tests fail under `Pacific/Kiritimati` and pass under UTC. After the fix, parent Cursor/Agy tests pass under `-race` in both zones; sessions vet and the full offline `nogui` build pass. Full repository tests and non-Linux runtimes were not run. AI-assisted implementation and review.",
